      "body": "### 项目地址\n\nhttps://github.com/glidea/zenfeed\n\n### 类别\n\nGo\n\n### 项目标题\n\n用 AI 赋能 RSS，帮你减少信息焦虑，高效编排你的信息获取工作流\n\n### 项目描述\n\n![](https://github.com/glidea/zenfeed/raw/main/docs/images/crad.png)\n\ndemo 网站：https://zenfeed.xyz/\n\n### 亮点\n\n**HTML 可视化总结**：重点一目了然\n**开放集成，开发者友好**：语义查询 API，通知 Webhook，高度自定义的声明式 YAML 配置...\n\n\n### 截图或演示视频\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a22b86e7-e718-4681-a69b-3d24712b32fd)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/873c9b7d-d33c-41a7-b213-859c9a8b07d0)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/358b2063-1792-47cb-ae3b-910ae0bb985f)\n\nMore: https://github.com/glidea/zenfeed/blob/main/docs/preview.md",
